(SUMMARY) per domain: (i) an answer witnessed only by a value the label never holds in a match of the program (measured against PROG-ALL's set, so PROG-ALL's 0 is by construction); (ii) two spellings of one program split (2SP, EB1 A/B, EB2, EB3); (iii) two spellings of one set split (SET <5, ZE a = 0); (iv) record = & (RZ, ZE, EB1 C/A); the fixed point (TOP vs BOTTOM) over PART 1
